(122, '', '', 'Alistaire', 'De Leon', NULL, NULL, 'Unit 3105/560 Lonsdale', 'Melbourne', '2', '3000', '16', '0452481082', 'alistairedeleon@gmail.com', 'alistairedeleon', '03-10-1982', NULL, NULL, 'Exceltacion', 'Lasam-De Leon', 'Wife', 'Unit 3105/560 Lonsdale', 'Melbourne', '2', '3000', '16', 'Social Media (Facebook / Twitter / LinkedIn)', NULL, 'yes', 'I have mostly worked with children, teens and young adults with intellectual disabilities since I started. I supported them with their community access needs, we played sports be it indoor or outdoor and I helped domestically by tidying up their rooms and by washing and hanging their clothes, too. We go to parks, to the local places and looked after them while their parents were away for a short period of time. I prefer to work in community support as time can be flexible for the client and I. The parents of my clients are at ease and satisfied whenever I provide the service needed as I handle my clients with genuine care and I make sure they are safe with me. Sports is my passion, let\'s be fit together!', 'no', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'All Support Services,Personal Care,Help In The Community,Help At Home,Transport Assistance', 'PEG (Percutaneous Endoscopic Gastronomy),Manual Handling (Lifting / Hoisting / Transfers),Mealtime Assistance & Feeding,Medication Administration,Bowel Care,Catheter or Condom Drainage,Wound / Pressure Care,Shallow Suctioning,Anaphylaxis,Epilepsy or Seizure', 'Yes I currently work for one or more other disability services providers', 'Mable', NULL, NULL, '2', NULL, '16', 'Support network', NULL, NULL, '2', NULL, '16', 'Unit 3105/560 Lonsdale', 'Melbourne', '2', '3000', '16', 'alistairedeleon@gmail.com', '0452481082', 'no', NULL, 'no', NULL, 'yes', 'no', 'yes', '{\"day\":{\"1\":\"Monday\",\"2\":\"Tuesday\",\"3\":\"Wednesday\",\"4\":\"Thursday\",\"5\":\"Friday\",\"6\":\"Saturday\",\"7\":\"Sunday\"},\"from\":{\"1\":\"8:00 am\",\"2\":\"9:00 am\",\"3\":\"8:00 am\",\"4\":\"8:00 am\",\"5\":\"-\",\"